<title>PHILIPPINES: Asiatrust, Republic Glass set div record dates.</title>
<headline>Asiatrust, Republic Glass set div record dates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asiatrust Development Bank Inc said on Wednesday it has set the record date of its 50 percent stock dividend on May 8.</p>
<p>Republic Glass Holdings Corp said its 25 percent stock dividend will be payable to stockholders on record April 30. - Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
